{"id":"n26150-1-10","stage":2,"title":"중얼거리다 · 嘟哝","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26150-1-10-1","ko":"지나가는 일꾼들이 사장에 대한 불만을 중얼거리더라.","zh":"路过的工人们当时在嘀咕着对老板的不满呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지나가는","meaning":"通过，路过","explanation":"지나가다：通过，路过；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"지나가다","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60216","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지나가는","audio":"/audio/0325dd97302bcd077108.mp3"}},{"text":"일꾼들이","meaning":"工作人员","explanation":"일꾼：工作人员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일꾼","audio":"/audio/5da8657419af3f6d7040.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72211","senseId":"2","lemma":"일꾼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일꾼들이","audio":"/audio/7fb6bab10e0718ef370d.mp3"}},{"text":"사장에","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사장에","audio":"/audio/e8a3831ee9a8f0226f6f.mp3"}},{"text":"대한","meaning":"对，对于","explanation":"대하다：对，对于；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"3","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대한","audio":"/audio/1d9b6fadeae799dde72f.mp3"}},{"text":"불만을","meaning":"不满，不满意","explanation":"불만：不满，不满意；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불만","audio":"/audio/b824c626e411b4df73f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60241","senseId":"1","lemma":"불만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불만을","audio":"/audio/0f94747e0dae4601bea8.mp3"}},{"text":"중얼거리더라.","meaning":"嘟哝，喃喃自语","explanation":"중얼거리다：嘟哝，喃喃自语；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"중얼거리다","audio":"/audio/090ef0502aa8636ebe8b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26150","senseId":"1","lemma":"중얼거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중얼거리더라","audio":"/audio/3db86654b9bd6587894b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9c25392f9bf0bb82","term":"지나가다","zh":"通过，路过","audio":"/audio/9c25392f9bf0bb82799e.mp3","entryId":"60216","definition":"经过某个地方。","pronunciation":["지나가다"]},{"id":"5da8657419af3f6d","term":"일꾼","zh":"工作人员","audio":"/audio/5da8657419af3f6d7040.mp3","entryId":"72211","definition":"负责做某事的人；或指要做某事的人。","pronunciation":["일ː꾼"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"4033b88da1605ad4","term":"대하다","zh":"对，对于","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3","entryId":"86300","definition":"当作对象或对方。","pronunciation":["대ː하다"]},{"id":"b824c626e411b4df","term":"불만","zh":"不满，不满意","audio":"/audio/b824c626e411b4df73f8.mp3","entryId":"60241","definition":"内心不满足。","pronunciation":["불만"]},{"id":"090ef0502aa8636e","term":"중얼거리다","zh":"嘟哝，喃喃自语","audio":"/audio/090ef0502aa8636ebe8b.mp3","entryId":"26150","definition":"以别人听不到的小而低的声音不停地自言自语。","pronunciation":["중얼거리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4fecd51bc5ae2b953ed.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26150-1-10-2","ko":"그 작은 소리를 들었어?","zh":"你听到那细微的声音了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"작은","meaning":"（声音）小，低","explanation":"작다：（声音）小，低；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"작다","audio":"/audio/bc42f85bf5be37c92f7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69513","senseId":"5","lemma":"작다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작은","